<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BORDER 32-2 AT LUNCH, 332 NEEDED.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BORDER 32-2 AT LUNCH, 332 NEEDED.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Border were 32-2 at lunch on the fourth and final day of their Supersport Series match against Free State at Springbok Park on Tuesday. </p>
<p>Free State earlier declared their second innings closed on 297 for nine wickets leaving Border a victory target of 332.</p>
<p>Free State 401 and 297-9 declared</p>
<p>Border 367-9 declared and 32-2.</p>
</text>
